              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <CheckCircle2 class="w-4 h-4 text-primary mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" />
                <span>Local Denver: Hourly rate typically applies</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <CheckCircle2 class="w-4 h-4 text-primary mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" />
